    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextSceneName
      value: D-8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Can you believe it? Mr. Kronos is such a kind person.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: ...But once he finds out I'm a robot, he'll run away from me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Hey, don't laugh. Just hear me out...\nThere\u2019s a strange rumor
        going around the company."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: Apparently, there's someone selling something that can turn robots into
        humans!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'Even if I am a model designed for product inspection,

        I don''t
        just believe everything I hear.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: . . .
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: But if, by some chance, something like that really were possible...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[7]'
      value: If I can keep my fuel running and still feel this kind of happiness,
        maybe this isn't such a bad life after all.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3298234864207022646, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[8]'
      value: If I can keep my fuel running and still feel this kind of happiness,
        maybe this isn't such a bad life after all.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: chatImg
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: startOfGame
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: nextSceneName
      value: D-8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: introTexts.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[0]'
      value: "\uBBFF\uC5B4\uC838\uC694? \uD06C\uB85C\uB178\uC2A4\uB2D8\uC740 \uC815\uB9D0
        \uB2E4\uC815\uD55C \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774\uC5D0\uC694. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "... \uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC, \uB0B4\uAC00 \uB85C\uBD07\uC774\uB77C\uB294
        \uAC78 \uC54C\uAC8C \uB418\uBA74 \uB098\uC5D0\uAC8C\uC11C \uB3C4\uB9DD\uCE58\uACA0\uC8E0."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "\uC800\uAE30, \uBE44\uC6C3\uC9C0 \uB9D0\uACE0 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uC8FC\uC138\uC694...
        \uD68C\uC0AC\uC5D0 \uC774\uC0C1\uD55C \uC18C\uBB38\uC774 \uB3CC\uACE0 \uC788\uC5B4\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "\uAE00\uC384, \uB85C\uBD07\uB3C4 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uB418\uAC8C \uD574\uC8FC\uB294
        \uBB3C\uAC74\uC744 \uD30C\uB294 \uC0C1\uC778\uC774 \uC788\uB300\uC694!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: "\uC544\uBB34\uB9AC \uC81C\uAC00 \uC81C\uD488\uAC80\uC218\uC6A9 \uBAA8\uB378\uC774\uB77C\uC9C0\uB9CC,
        \uADF8\uB7F0 \uB9D0\uC744 \uC27D\uAC8C \uD559\uC2B5\uD558\uC9C0\uB294 \uC54A\uB294\uB2E4\uACE0\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[5]'
      value: . . .
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4521109688250147309, guid: bc3cfb429ef802c41b964ff4fb62c661, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'introTexts.Array.data[6]'
      value: "\uC815\uB9D0 \uB9CC\uC57D\uC5D0, \uADF8\uB7F0 \uC77C\uC774 \uAC00\uB2A5\uD558\uB2E4\uBA74
        ..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
